      "instance_name": "military_threat_scene",
      "label": "military_threat_scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting a soldier in combat gear holding a rifle with a scope, set against a plain white background. The soldier is in a prone position, focused on a target. The scene is framed by text overlays that provoke a reaction by juxtaposing the phrase 'Allahu Akbar' with militarized imagery, creating an analogical mapping that equates the religious phrase with violence or terrorism. This scene is designed to incite hostility or fear toward Muslims by associating the phrase with military aggression, thereby promoting Islamophobia.",
