      "instance_name": "islamophobia_stereotype",
      "label": "Islamophobia Stereotype",
      "description": "The meme relies on the stereotype that the phrase 'Allahu Akbar' is inherently linked to terrorism or violence, which is a common form of Islamophobia. This stereotype equates religious expression with aggression, promoting fear and prejudice against Muslims.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_16a009d4"
