      "instance_name": "militarized_aggression_stereotype",
      "label": "Militarized Aggression Stereotype",
      "description": "The image of the soldier in combat gear, aiming a rifle, is used to symbolize militarized aggression. This visual is juxtaposed with the phrase 'Allahu Akbar' to imply that the phrase is associated with violence, which is a harmful stereotype that misrepresents the peaceful nature of many religious expressions.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
