      "instance_name": "mapping_id_1",
      "label": "Allahu Akbar phrase is mapped onto militarized aggression",
      "description": "The textual phrase 'say allahu akbar again...' is juxtaposed with the visual of a soldier in combat gear holding a rifle, creating an analogical mapping that equates the religious phrase with militarized aggression. This mapping is central to the meme's hateful intent, as it falsely associates the phrase with violence and terrorism, promoting Islamophobia.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
